{"resource":{"id":"dl-learning-roadmap","title":"Deep Learning \u2014 Learning Roadmap","category":"AI & Data","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"8 min","pages":8,"lastUpdated":"January 2026","tags":["Deep Learning","DL","PyTorch"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1677442136019-21780ecad995?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A visual, week-by-week roadmap from Python fundamentals to production deep learning. Milestones, projects, certifications, and portfolio goals for AI engineering careers."},"toc":[{"id":"prerequisites","label":"1. Prerequisites"},{"id":"python","label":"2. Python Fundamentals"},{"id":"math","label":"3. Mathematics for DL"},{"id":"nn","label":"4. Neural Networks"},{"id":"cv","label":"5. Computer Vision"},{"id":"nlp","label":"6. Natural Language Processing"},{"id":"transformers","label":"7. Transformers & Foundation Models"},{"id":"pytorch","label":"8. PyTorch Mastery"},{"id":"mlops","label":"9. Deployment & MLOps"},{"id":"career","label":"10. Career Preparation"},{"id":"review","label":"Roadmap Review"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"glossary","label":"Glossary"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Deep Learning \u2014 Frequently Asked Questions","tag":"AI & Data","time":"10 min"},{"title":"Deep Learning \u2014 Tips & Tricks","tag":"AI & Data","time":"8 min"},{"title":"Deep Learning \u2014 Reference Guide","tag":"AI & Data","time":"38 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"prerequisites\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Prerequisites</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-sky-500/40 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-900 dark:text-sky-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\"></p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">} title=\"Before you start\">\n          <ul class=\"mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n            <li>Comfortable with high-school math (algebra, functions).</li>\n            <li>Basic terminal + git literacy.</li>\n            <li>Willing to commit ~8 hours/week for 6 months.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div></div></div></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1677442136019-21780ecad995?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 \u2014 24-week roadmap: prerequisites \u2192 fundamentals \u2192 domains \u2192 mastery \u2192 career.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"review\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Visual Roadmap (24-week timeline)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border\">\n          <table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\n            <thead class=\"bg-muted/40\">\n              <tr>\n                <th class=\"p-3 text-left\">Weeks</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3 text-left\">Stage</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3 text-left\">Focus</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3 text-left\">Milestone project</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              {STAGES.map((s) => (\n                <tr key={s.stage} class=\"border-t\">\n                  <td class=\"p-3 font-mono\">{s.weeks}</td>\n                  <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold\">{s.stage}</td>\n                  <td class=\"p-3\">{s.focus}</td>\n                  <td class=\"p-3 text-muted-foreground\">{s.project}</td>\n                </tr>\n              ))}\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"python\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Python Fundamentals</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Data types, control flow, functions, comprehensions.</li>\n          <li>Numpy: arrays, broadcasting, vectorised ops.</li>\n          <li>Env hygiene \u2014 venv / conda + <code>pip install -r requirements.txt</code>.</li>\n          <li>Notebook + script workflows; git commits per experiment.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"math\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Mathematics for Deep Learning</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Vectors, matrices, dot products, matrix multiplication.</li>\n          <li>Derivatives, partial derivatives, chain rule.</li>\n          <li>Probability: distributions, expectation, entropy, KL divergence.</li>\n          <li>Just enough optimisation intuition \u2014 gradients point uphill.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"nn\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Neural Networks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Perceptron \u2192 MLP \u2192 forward &amp; backward pass by hand once.</li>\n          <li>Activations, losses, optimisers vocabulary.</li>\n          <li>PyTorch basics \u2014 tensors, autograd, <code>nn.Module</code>.</li>\n          <li>Train a baseline MLP on MNIST before touching CNNs.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"cv\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Computer Vision</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Convolution, pooling, receptive fields.</li>\n          <li>Augmentation: flip, crop, colour jitter, mixup, cutmix.</li>\n          <li>Fine-tuning a ResNet / ConvNeXt on a custom dataset.</li>\n          <li>Segmentation &amp; detection heads for higher-level tasks.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"nlp\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Natural Language Processing</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Tokenisation, embeddings, positional encoding.</li>\n          <li>Sequence models: RNN \u2192 LSTM \u2192 transformer.</li>\n          <li>HuggingFace Transformers for fine-tuning classifiers.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"transformers\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Transformers &amp; Foundation Models</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Encoder, decoder, encoder-decoder patterns.</li>\n          <li>PEFT (LoRA/QLoRA) for cheap adaptation of large models.</li>\n          <li>Retrieval-augmented generation, evaluation, and safety.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"pytorch\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. PyTorch Mastery</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Distributed: DDP \u2192 FSDP / ZeRO for large models.</li>\n          <li>Mixed precision (bf16), gradient accumulation, checkpointing.</li>\n          <li><code>torch.compile</code>, profiler-driven optimisation.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mlops\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Deployment &amp; MLOps</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Export: TorchScript, ONNX, TensorRT.</li>\n          <li>Serve: Triton, TorchServe, BentoML, vLLM (LLMs).</li>\n          <li>Observe: latency, drift, quality, per-cohort dashboards.</li>\n          <li>CI/CD for models \u2014 reproducible builds, canary rollouts.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620712943543-bcc4688e7485?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 \u2014 Deep learning lifecycle: data \u2192 train \u2192 evaluate \u2192 deploy \u2192 monitor \u2192 iterate.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"career\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Career Preparation</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Portfolio goals</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Three flagship projects: CV, NLP/LLM, and an end-to-end deployed demo.</li>\n          <li>Public write-ups explaining trade-offs \u2014 not just code.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Certifications</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>DeepLearning.AI Specializations (Coursera).</li>\n          <li>NVIDIA DLI courses.</li>\n          <li>fast.ai Practical Deep Learning.</li>\n          <li>Cloud ML certifications (AWS/GCP/Azure) when relevant.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Interview preparation</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Backprop, regularisation, attention, evaluation, deployment.</li>\n          <li>ML system design \u2014 data, feature store, training, serving, monitoring.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Readiness checklist</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Can debug a training loop with <code>NaN</code> loss end-to-end.</li>\n          <li>Can fine-tune a pretrained model on new data in under a day.</li>\n          <li>Can ship a model to a simple API with a monitored SLO.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Follow the sequence \u2014 math + Python before frameworks, fundamentals before transformers.</li>\n          <li>Ship one project per stage; retrospectives beat passive tutorials.</li>\n          <li>Deployment is a first-class skill, not an afterthought.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>How strict is the timeline?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Suggestive, not sacred. Slow down where you're weak; skip topics you already know cold.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Can I skip classical ML?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Only briefly. Understanding regression / trees keeps interviews and baselines honest.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>What if I only have a laptop?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Fine \u2014 do the first 12 weeks locally, then rent a Colab / cloud GPU for larger runs.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"glossary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Milestone</strong> \u2014 completion criterion for a stage.</li>\n          <li><strong>PEFT</strong> \u2014 Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning.</li>\n          <li><strong>MLOps</strong> \u2014 engineering practice around production ML.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          This resource is intended for educational purposes only. Information is compiled from official documentation,\n          academic publications, research papers, industry standards, and trusted educational resources. Deep learning\n          technologies, frameworks, APIs, and best practices evolve continuously \u2014 consult the latest official\n          documentation and current course syllabi before making career decisions. All trademarks, logos, product names,\n          and intellectual property belong to their respective owners.\n        </p>\n      </div></section>"}